<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Sarah\'92s face burned, her lies growing flimsier. She doubled down. \'93We went to a Vegas Show...\'94\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Eloise stiffened. \'93A Vegas Show? I\'92d rather be in a war zone.\'94\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93It was actually wonderful,\'94 Sarah confessed, reconnecting with her own memory of joy. \'93I\'92ll be free to follow my own heart,\'94 she quoted.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Eloise shifted uncomfortably, unaccustomed to anyone\'92s authentic happiness.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93We were so happy that night,\'94 Sarah murmured. \'93It felt... right.\'94\
