<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93Then why, on the twelfth of February, were you at the Blue Shade\'97an Elvi bar; then again on the seventeenth of March at the Memphis Mafia\'97another Elvi bar\'97with John Stoat?\'94 Eloise waved her tablet. \'93What about these photos on his feed? You\'92re clearly having a good time.\'94\
